I am in my room.
A box of sweets is on my desk.
I sit on the chair.
My laptop is on the desk.
I open the laptop.
I make a video call home.
I wait.
Here in Mumbai, it is Sunday morning.
But in Mexico, it is still Saturday evening.
My family is there.
This is my first video call.
I am very happy.
The screen is black right now.
Then it rings.
The call connects.
I hear a voice.
Who is that?
It is my mother's voice.
The laptop screen lights up.
